{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note:</i></strong><i> The initial loading time may take a minute or two, but there are no other loading screens throughout the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let The Catnip Coma Begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a young cat on a mental journey through his cloudy mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough catnip to progress to the next level. Collect up to 1,000 catnip flowers across 10 levels. Each catnip is guarded by enemies that can be defeated with your kick attacks. More attacks are unlocked as you proceed through the first five levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Can\u2019t He Talk?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at flashbacks and conversations with your subconscious as the trauma* unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.poster.avif?t=1769263280\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.webm?t=1769263280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.mp4?t=1769263280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Boss fights related to this will be added in a future build. Coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy With Up To Four Players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can get the most catnip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything unlocked in Story mode becomes available in Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the scope of each round with anywhere from 10 to 100 catnip per match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Earworms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is inspired by fast chiptune and breakcore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With &quot;easy,&quot; &quot;normal,&quot; and &quot;hard&quot; difficulty settings, Catnip Fever Dreamland can be enjoyed by both casual and avid gamers alike. Stay tuned as even more features will be added in future builds!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474530?t=1769263280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/182e7d7a359dfaf337e98e5cf5d3dfea9361d216/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769263280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/c0493cc50e49e81543afbc7eefd631669d16c819/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769263280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/c0493cc50e49e81543afbc7eefd631669d16c819/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769263280","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Catnip Fever Dreamland is based on an experience caused by a fictional \"drug.\" While the \"drug\" in the game is merely an exaggerated depiction of catnip, the overall theme is based on drug addiction in general; catnip is smoked as if it were weed rolled in joints, but depicted as something much stronger than THC. Impressionable children should not play this game. Do not smoke catnip irl!"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Note:</i></strong><i> The initial loading time may take a minute or two, but there are no other loading screens throughout the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let The Catnip Coma Begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a young cat on a mental journey through his cloudy mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough catnip to progress to the next level. Collect up to 1,000 catnip flowers across 10 levels. Each catnip is guarded by enemies that can be defeated with your kick attacks. More attacks are unlocked as you proceed through the first five levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Can\u2019t He Talk?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at flashbacks and conversations with your subconscious as the trauma* unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.poster.avif?t=1769263280\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.webm?t=1769263280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/extras/b0c389cea9f97c9d8bf5591c5d27630d.mp4?t=1769263280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Boss fights related to this will be added in a future build. Coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy With Up To Four Players</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See who can get the most catnip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything unlocked in Story mode becomes available in Multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the scope of each round with anywhere from 10 to 100 catnip per match!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Earworms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is inspired by fast chiptune and breakcore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With &quot;easy,&quot; &quot;normal,&quot; and &quot;hard&quot; difficulty settings, Catnip Fever Dreamland can be enjoyed by both casual and avid gamers alike. Stay tuned as even more features will be added in future builds!</strong></p>","developers":["Aqueous"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474530/header.jpg?t=1769263280","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Catnip Fever Dreamland is a pending trademark set to be owned by Aqueous LLC. Characters in this game are copyright protected.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474530/1667867727/63cd5fcf611f4143ac9d9f8e03ab528945993c09/1752797499/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752798472","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474530/1667867727/63cd5fcf611f4143ac9d9f8e03ab528945993c09/1752797499/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752798472","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3474530/1667867727/63cd5fcf611f4143ac9d9f8e03ab528945993c09/1752797499/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752798472","id":257090023,"name":"Official Catnip Fever Dreamland Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090023/3b924dd81850c36a53bdc061ae5b7a060e324fde/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752798472"}],"name":"Catnip Fever Dreamland","pa